    "created_at": "2016-02-08T19:29:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-08T19:29:01Z",
    "body": "Hmm, found https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=18547 but that's pretty old... Ahah, it was at https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-script-coord/2015JanMar/0109.html, which has some good discussion\n\nIt seems in https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-script-coord/2015JanMar/0122.html we settled on the plan you mentioned, that [ImplicitThis] should be the only behavior in IDL.\n\nHappy to keep this bug open as a tracking bug on HTML, but yeah, the work to do here is in IDL. I will update https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=18547 with the plan of record so we can find it later.\n",
